  "contentHtml": "<p>판구조론 수업에 쓸 수 있는 지진분포, 화산분포, 토포그래피, 해양지각 나이, 판 PDF 자료 입니다.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; line-height: 1.6; background-color: transparent;\">원래 외국 자료는 판의 경계를 발견하는 활동으로 이루어져&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; line-height: 1.6; background-color: transparent;\">있습니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">http://plateboundary.rice.edu/</span></p><p><br></p><p>저는 아직 수업 안했는데요.</p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 1.6;\">이 자료를 모둠별로 나누어주고 어떤 수업을 하면 좋을까요?</span></p><p>아이디어 하나씩 부탁드려요.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D78%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20140408151106&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile295.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F2534333C534392713BCBA7')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_pdf_s.gif?rv=1.0.1\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> age.11.17.pdf</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D78%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20140408151106&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile264.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F213C263C534392710ECA02')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_pdf_s.gif?rv=1.0.1\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> plate.11.17.pdf</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D78%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20140408151106&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile266.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F213C483C5343927310FC38')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_pdf_s.gif?rv=1.0.1\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> quakes.11.17.pdf</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D78%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20140408151106&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile274.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F275E083C534392742B98F4')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_pdf_s.gif?rv